# 02 — Smart Inventory Manager

## Overview

Develop an inventory management system for small businesses to manage products, stock, sales, suppliers, and invoices.

## Core Features

* Product management
* Stock tracking
* Supplier management
* Sales records
* Purchase records
* Invoice management
* Low-stock alerts
* Inventory reports

## Possible Extensions

* Demand forecasting
* Automatic low-stock prediction
* Sales analytics
* Barcode integration
* AI-based inventory recommendations

## Suggested Difficulty
 Intermediate

